<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have arrested five suspects linked to the Vizsla silver mining murders, including a man known as El Talibán, while a federal indictment added another Amarillo man to a Sinaloa Cartel weapons conspiracy. An Arizona man killed a dentist in Nogales over bad work and was later killed in a shootout with Mexican police, and a separate Arizona child murder suspect was detained in Mexico after a decade on the run. Journalists continue to be targeted, with 169 murders recorded over 20 years, the longest peacetime wave, according to RSF. Ukrainian-origin fiber-optic drones are under investigation for use by Mexican cartels, prompting FAA restrictions on border drones. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPQ2J4RHIwY0c5ZmwzaGg4VmNYbG5kYWNwckU4d3dYSWxyUUVKMDk0U01jcm5fSllLMk91NEFDcDhraTlTS2Foa0dfbkZUQ0Jpa3NHZEp3NkpORkk4bHdzWTJPWlEtTHF5YlQ3SkpwZWYtbm4zb2U2dHBOT3c0ZWs3dEtEY0dvSmxMNGlvYlVDX254N1IyQTNhN2xLWTFncnozWTVsSEJ3dm5JOXhlWjFkMGl2WmpqMmRyRldqNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KVOA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFBMM3RYQ0Zxd0xEb2J3aTdNbkx0M2dRYm1LU2tvQ0FyUDBNMEd0TFNmb1g1RUpXZVNNZ2lrQ0V3azI1X3lIMHNFNDdGb0ZLbE95cVdsZWptRkhONGtTeFpXTF84WWtYVElpMFhtejBHcFZYcHFTbTZhMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;BorderReport&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPMWUtTmswZnFrb3JsRC1ab19CTnNHTy1uMGhYdmlERkpMbXdqSlRST2lTWUlGMzlnS2V4N1huZnB1THA5LUFmZmNUSHZzY2JuLXF4YnI0V21jc050ZnVVUm14cktVdkpkVEg5ZUR0SThmRTNDMko2NHFZLW55U1FtVDJKbXdRUjE3ejE5dFNmV0tlc0IxUmY2SWFBQ